                                "sense_id": "69a2e3ab-65fb-3269-a7a8-98a9a5c7721a",
                                "text": "1724, Louis Ellies Du Pin, Vertot (abbé de), Jean de Vayrac, The History of the Revolutions in Spain\n[…] rejoins the Moors with a Number of Gothish Officers […]"
                            },
                            {
